{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>For a man such as I shall surely divine, etc.</b> That is to say, an important man such as myself is not lacking in knowledge of the wisdom of divination — either he or his men — in order to clarify any doubt that arises for him concerning it, and to know every theft that is stolen from him, in whose hand it is."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:03.359498508Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}